        "content": "## ⚡ Yelp & TripAdvisor Restaurant Menu Item Prices & Local Hospitality Leads\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nExtract restaurant menu pricing, dish categories, and POS/ordering links for F&B suppliers and restaurant SaaS sales.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/yelp-tripadvisor-restaurant-menu-pricing-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/yelp-tripadvisor-restaurant-menu-pricing-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Restaurant Menu & Price Scraper Yelp** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
